---
---
<!-- =========================================================================
     SECTION 4: COMPANY OVERVIEW & KEUNGGULAN (Matching Lower White Area of Reference)
     ========================================================================= -->
<section class="py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Company Overview, Stats & 3 Core USPs -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-nusa-blue">Mengapa Memilih NUSA Tour & Travel?</span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-nusa-dark mt-2">
            Bebas Repot, 100% Berangkat, 100% Menyenangkan.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <p class="text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
          Membawa rombongan puluhan orang menyeberangi perbatasan negara membutuhkan koordinasi yang presisi. Tim kami di Indonesia dan Malaysia memastikan setiap detail—mulai dari paspor, imigrasi, bus pariwisata, hingga makanan halal yang cocok di lidah—tertangani secara menyeluruh.
        </p>

        <!-- Statistics Box (Matching +15 / +350 / +80 in SkyStructure Reference) -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 py-6 border-y border-slate-200">
          <div class="pr-4 border-r border-slate-200">
            <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-nusa-blue">3</span>
            <span class="text-lg font-bold text-nusa-gold ml-1">Negara</span>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 font-medium mt-1">Fokus Spesialis Malaysia, Singapura & Thailand</p>
          </div>
          <div class="px-2 sm:px-4 border-r border-slate-200">
            <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-nusa-blue">+1.000</span>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 font-medium mt-1">Peserta Siswa, Instansi & Keluarga Diberangkatkan</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pl-2 sm:pl-4">
            <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-nusa-blue">100%</span>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 font-medium mt-1">Harga Transparan Tanpa Biaya Tersembunyi</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3 Poin Keunggulan (PRD Section 4) -->
        <div class="space-y-4 pt-2">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-nusa-blue flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-file-invoice-dollar"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-nusa-dark text-base">1. Harga Transparan di Awal</h4>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Rincian anggaran jelas sejak pengajuan proposal. Tidak ada biaya tersembunyi, tips paksa, atau pungutan tak terduga di lapangan.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-nusa-gold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-user-tie"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-nusa-dark text-base">2. Tim Lapangan Ahli di Negara Tujuan</h4>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Didampingi langsung oleh <em>Tour Leader</em> profesional yang hafal medan lokal, prosedur imigrasi, budaya, serta rute kuliner terbaik.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 font-bold">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-sliders"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-nusa-dark text-base">3. Itinerary 100% Fleksibel (Custom)</h4>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Ingin sisipkan agenda kunjungan universitas, MoU sekolah, atau waktu belanja khusus? Kami siap merombak jadwal sesuai keinginan rombongan.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Visual Composition -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-4 border-slate-100">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1537996194471-e657df975ab4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" 
                 alt="Suasana Perjalanan Rombongan Nusa Tour" 
                 class="w-full h-[440px] object-cover"
                 data-fallback-src="https://placehold.co/700x500/0B1E3B/FFFFFF?text=Nusa+Tour+Experience">
          </div>
          
          <!-- Floating Consultation Badge -->
          <div class="bg-nusa-navy text-white p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-white/10 mt-4 sm:mt-0 sm:absolute sm:-bottom-6 sm:-left-6 sm:max-w-xs">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
              <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-nusa-gold">Layanan B2B & Instansi</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">
              Butuh lampiran dokumen legalitas PT & RAB untuk rapat panitia sekolah atau kantor?
            </p>
            <button onclick="openBrochureModal()" class="mt-3 text-xs font-bold text-sky-400 hover:text-nusa-gold flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>Unduh Dokumen Proposal</span>
              <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
